{
  "_version": "1.0.0",
  "_description": "HubSpot Audit Log + Webhook Events → AKSI control ID mapping. HubSpot is the dominant SMB/midmarket CRM; HubSpot Breeze (Copilot + Agents) reads and mutates Contacts, Deals, Companies, Tickets, and Engagements (emails, notes, calls, tasks). Agent-driven creations are flagged for review (PR-01), agent-driven contact deletions and autonomous deal closures are governance failures (PR-02), property changes touching sensitive PII (ssn/tax_id/credit_card/passport) and large autonomous deal mutations are cryptographic / data-protection failures (PR-04 BLOCK), and Breeze-generated emails are flagged as outbound communication surfaces (PR-04). Bulk exports above threshold, new external webhooks, app installs, and Super Admin promotions are all surfaced. All identifiers are sanitized: actor.user_id and target.object_id retain only the last 8 characters, actor.email is reduced to domain-only, webhook URLs to host-only, client IPs to /16, and properties_changed VALUES are NEVER stored — only the key list.",
